  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6c4b9da7-e6f0-4df9-81f7-933be6a26696.png\" style=\"width:1.97361in;height:1.43333in\" /><br />Let, the lengths of the semi-major axis and semi-minor axis of the&nbsp;ellipse are&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>b</mi></math> respectively, then the distance of the focus <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the corresponding directrix <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />Distance between the focus and centre <math><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />The slope of the axis of the ellipse is <math><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The points on the axis of the ellipse at a distance <math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> units from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Points are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> , but the centre is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> because it is far from the directrix as compared to <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.",
